  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">來自《Gentler Weather Sounds》的獨立閃電與雷聲音效</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">雖然我非常喜歡製作《Gentler Weather Sounds》的成果（並且強烈推薦大家使用！），但也明白完全替換未必適合所有人。因此，這個資源包僅提供降雨音效！</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>在較舊版本中，資源包選擇畫面可能會顯示警告訊息，但音效仍可向下相容至 1.7 版本！</em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.sparkedhost.com%252faff.php%253faff%253d3146\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/dc9280455e1c94978a408dde3d6785bce2a4503d_0.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"300\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/fedaf482bc67551db7b0879b1a86e0e82ca535a4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"150\" height=\"23\"></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>未標註來源的音效均由我設計與錄製</p>\n<p>所有音效均已重新編輯，以確保整體搭配更為協調</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpixabay.com%252fsound-effects%252frain-and-thunder-nature-sounds-7803%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://pixabay.com/sound-effects/rain-and-thunder-nature-sounds-7803/</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpixabay.com%252fsound-effects%252fsoft-rain-ambient-111154%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://pixabay.com/sound-effects/soft-rain-ambient-111154/</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffreesound.org%252fpeople%252fshelbyshark%252fsounds%252f513394%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://freesound.org/people/shelbyshark/sounds/513394/</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpixabay.com%252fsound-effects%252fcopyright-free-rain-sounds-331497%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://pixabay.com/sound-effects/copyright-free-rain-sounds-331497/</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffreesound.org%252fpeople%252fSoundrack%252fsounds%252f733288%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://freesound.org/people/Soundrack/sounds/733288/</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpixabay.com%252fsound-effects%252fcalm-rain-ambience-421001%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://pixabay.com/sound-effects/calm-rain-ambience-421001/</a></p>\n</div>",
